---
description: Keep machine paths out of rules, skills, and agent files.
alwaysApply: true
---

# Local paths

Project data stays on this machine. Rules, skills, and agent files use paths inside the repository.

- Write `app/`, `tests/`, `docs/`, and `.cursor/management/`.
- Do not write a user profile, home directory, drive letter, or absolute path.
- Do not copy a local path into a skill, agent prompt, commit message, or shared note.

```text
Bad: C:\Users\<name>\Desktop\RoS_Server\app
Good: app/
```
